        "node_id": "n_6_263f09",
        "thought_text": "Use a bipartite matching algorithm to maximize the number of bugs fixed within the given pass limit. Treat bugs as one set of vertices and students as another, with edges weighted by the passes required. Find a maximum matching that respects the pass limit and minimizes the number of days.",
